const BANK = [{"theme":"学校","p1":[{"t":"Where is my pencil case?","o":["It's on your desk.","At three o'clock.","I like blue."],"a":1,"j":"「私の筆箱はどこ？」ときかれたので、場所を答えている1番「あなたの机の上だよ」が正解です。"},{"t":"Do you walk to school?","o":["Yes, it was fun.","No, I go by bike.","It's near the station."],"a":2,"j":"「歩いて学校に行くの？」に対して、2番「いいえ、自転車で行きます」が自然な答えです。"},{"t":"What's your favorite subject?","o":["On Monday.","In the classroom.","I like math."],"a":3,"j":"「いちばん好きな教科は？」なので、3番「数学が好きです」が正解。whatは「何」をたずねる言葉です。"},{"t":"When does the class start?","o":["At nine o'clock.","In the gym.","With my friend."],"a":1,"j":"whenは「いつ」。時刻を答えている1番「9時に」が正解です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Did you do your homework, Tom?","B: Yes, I finished it last night.","A: Great. Please give it to me."],"q":"When did Tom finish his homework?","o":["Last night.","This morning.","After lunch.","On Sunday."],"a":1,"j":"トムは I finished it last night「昨日の夜終わらせた」と言っています。"},{"d":["A: I can't find my English textbook.","B: Look, it's under your chair.","A: Oh, thank you!"],"q":"Where is the English textbook?","o":["On the desk.","Under the chair.","In the library.","In the bag."],"a":2,"j":"under your chair「いすの下」にありました。underは「〜の下」です。"},{"d":["A: Ms. Green, can I ask a question?","B: Sure. What is it?","A: How do you say this word?"],"q":"What does the boy want to do?","o":["Open the window.","Eat lunch.","Ask a question.","Go home."],"a":3,"j":"男の子は Can I ask a question?「質問してもいいですか」と言っています。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Ken goes to school by bus every day. The bus leaves at eight, so he gets up at seven. He likes his school very much.","q":"How does Ken go to school?","o":["By train.","He walks.","By bike.","By bus."],"a":4,"j":"最初の文で by bus「バスで」学校に行くと言っています。"},{"p":"Emi is a junior high school student. She is in the art club. She draws pictures every Tuesday and Friday after school.","q":"When does Emi draw pictures?","o":["On Tuesdays and Fridays.","Every day.","Every morning.","On weekends."],"a":1,"j":"every Tuesday and Friday「毎週火曜日と金曜日」に絵を描きます。"},{"p":"Today, our school had a music event. My class sang two songs. My mother came and enjoyed it very much.","q":"What did the class do at the event?","o":["They danced.","They sang songs.","They played soccer.","They made lunch."],"a":2,"j":"My class sang two songs「クラスで2曲歌った」と言っています。sangはsing（歌う）の過去形です。"}]},{"theme":"家族・週末","p1":[{"t":"What did you do last Sunday?","o":["I'll go tomorrow.","I watched a movie.","It's my sister's."],"a":2,"j":"「この前の日曜日は何をしたの？」なので、過去形で答えている2番「映画を見ました」が正解です。"},{"t":"Is that tall man your father?","o":["No, I don't.","It's ten dollars.","Yes, he is."],"a":3,"j":"「あの背の高い男の人はお父さん？」に対して、3番「はい、そうです」が正解。Is he...?にはhe isで答えます。"},{"t":"How many people are in your family?","o":["There are four.","Five years old.","At home."],"a":1,"j":"how manyは「いくつ」。人数を答えている1番「4人です」が正解です。"},{"t":"Whose camera is this?","o":["By train.","It's my mother's.","Yes, it is."],"a":2,"j":"whoseは「だれの」。2番「母のものです」が正解。my mother'sで「母のもの」という意味になります。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Dad, let's go to the park this weekend.","B: Sure. How about Saturday morning?","A: Perfect!"],"q":"When will they go to the park?","o":["Sunday morning.","Friday night.","Saturday morning.","Saturday evening."],"a":3,"j":"お父さんが How about Saturday morning?「土曜の朝はどう？」と言い、子どもがPerfect!と答えています。"},{"d":["A: Mike, is your sister a student?","B: No, she's a nurse. She works at a hospital.","A: That's nice."],"q":"What does Mike's sister do?","o":["She is a cook.","She is a teacher.","She is a student.","She is a nurse."],"a":4,"j":"マイクは she's a nurse「姉（妹）は看護師です」と言っています。"},{"d":["A: Grandma, this cake is delicious.","B: Thank you. I made it this morning.","A: Can I have one more piece?"],"q":"Who made the cake?","o":["His grandmother.","His mother.","A cook.","The boy."],"a":1,"j":"おばあさんが I made it「私が作ったのよ」と言っています。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Last Sunday, Yuta cleaned his room in the morning. In the afternoon, he played video games with his brother. He had a good day.","q":"What did Yuta do on Sunday morning?","o":["He played video games.","He cleaned his room.","He did his homework.","He watched TV."],"a":2,"j":"in the morning「午前中」に部屋のそうじをしました。ゲームをしたのは午後です。"},{"p":"My father likes fishing. Every month, he goes to the river with his friend. Sometimes I go with them, and we eat lunch by the river.","q":"How often does the father go fishing?","o":["Every day.","Every week.","Every month.","Every year."],"a":3,"j":"Every month「毎月」川に行くと言っています。how oftenは「どのくらいよく（ひんど）」をたずねます。"},{"p":"Aya's grandmother lives in Osaka. Aya visits her every summer. This year, they will go to a summer festival together.","q":"What will Aya and her grandmother do this year?","o":["Move to Osaka.","Visit Tokyo.","Have a party.","Go to a festival."],"a":4,"j":"will go to a summer festival「夏祭りに行く予定」と言っています。willは「〜するつもり」です。"}]},{"theme":"買い物","p1":[{"t":"May I help you?","o":["You're welcome.","Here you are.","Yes, I'm looking for a bag."],"a":3,"j":"店員さんの「いらっしゃいませ（お手伝いしましょうか）」には、3番「はい、かばんをさがしています」が自然です。"},{"t":"How much is this T-shirt?","o":["It's twenty dollars.","Three T-shirts.","At the store."],"a":1,"j":"how muchは「いくら」。値段を答えている1番「20ドルです」が正解です。"},{"t":"Which color do you like, red or blue?","o":["Two, please.","I like red.","Yes, I do."],"a":2,"j":"「赤と青、どちらが好き？」なので、2番「赤が好きです」が正解。whichは「どちら」です。"},{"t":"Excuse me. Where can I find milk?","o":["At seven.","That's all.","It's over there."],"a":3,"j":"「牛乳はどこにありますか」に、場所を教えている3番「あちらです」が正解です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: I want to buy new shoes, Mom.","B: OK. Let's go to the store after lunch.","A: Thanks!"],"q":"What does the boy want to buy?","o":["New shoes.","A bag.","Lunch.","A watch."],"a":1,"j":"男の子は I want to buy new shoes「新しいくつを買いたい」と言っています。"},{"d":["A: This cap is nice. How much is it?","B: It's fifteen dollars.","A: OK, I'll take it."],"q":"How much is the cap?","o":["Five dollars.","Fifteen dollars.","Fifty dollars.","Sixteen dollars."],"a":2,"j":"fifteen dollars「15ドル」です。fifteen（15）とfifty（50）の聞き分けに注意しましょう。"},{"d":["A: Did you go shopping yesterday, Kate?","B: Yes. I bought a present for my mother.","A: Oh, her birthday is soon, right?"],"q":"What did Kate buy?","o":["A cake.","A birthday card.","A present.","Some flowers."],"a":3,"j":"ケイトは I bought a present「プレゼントを買った」と言っています。boughtはbuy（買う）の過去形です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"There is a new supermarket near Rika's house. The vegetables there are cheap and fresh. Rika's mother goes there every Wednesday.","q":"When does Rika's mother go to the supermarket?","o":["Every Friday.","Every Sunday.","Every Monday.","Every Wednesday."],"a":4,"j":"every Wednesday「毎週水曜日」に行くと言っています。"},{"p":"Attention, shoppers. Today, all fruit is half price. Also, we are giving free cookies to children near the main door. Thank you for coming.","q":"What is half price today?","o":["All fruit.","All vegetables.","Cookies.","Drinks."],"a":1,"j":"お店の放送で all fruit is half price「くだもの全品半額」と言っています。"},{"p":"Jack wanted a new soccer ball, but he didn't have enough money. So he helped his father wash the car and got five dollars.","q":"Why did Jack help his father?","o":["He liked washing cars.","He wanted money.","His father was sick.","It was his job."],"a":2,"j":"新しいボールを買うお金が足りなかったので、車を洗う手伝いをして5ドルもらいました。"}]},{"theme":"食べ物・レストラン","p1":[{"t":"What would you like to drink?","o":["Orange juice, please.","I like pizza.","It's on the table."],"a":1,"j":"「お飲み物は何になさいますか」なので、飲み物を答えている1番「オレンジジュースをください」が正解です。"},{"t":"Do you want some more salad?","o":["It's Monday.","Yes, please.","See you."],"a":2,"j":"「サラダのおかわりはいる？」には、2番「はい、おねがいします」が自然な答えです。"},{"t":"Where did you have lunch today?","o":["Spaghetti.","With Lisa.","At a new restaurant."],"a":3,"j":"whereは「どこで」。場所を答えている3番「新しいレストランで」が正解です。"},{"t":"Whose sandwich is this?","o":["It's Jenny's.","It looks delicious.","At noon."],"a":1,"j":"whoseは「だれの」。1番「ジェニーのです」が正解です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Are you ready to order?","B: Yes. I'd like a hamburger and a cola.","A: Sure. Anything else?"],"q":"Where are they talking?","o":["At home.","At a school.","At a restaurant.","At a station."],"a":3,"j":"注文を取っているので、レストランでの会話だとわかります。orderは「注文する」です。"},{"d":["A: Mom, I'm hungry. What's for dinner?","B: We're having curry and rice tonight.","A: Yay! My favorite!"],"q":"What will they eat for dinner?","o":["Sandwiches.","Pizza.","Spaghetti.","Curry and rice."],"a":4,"j":"お母さんが curry and rice「カレーライスよ」と言っています。"},{"d":["A: This soup is too hot.","B: Then, wait a few minutes, Tim.","A: OK, I will."],"q":"What is Tim's problem?","o":["The soup is too hot.","He doesn't like soup.","He is not hungry.","The soup is cold."],"a":1,"j":"ティムは The soup is too hot「スープが熱すぎる」と言っています。too〜は「〜すぎる」です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Nick likes cooking. Last night, he made pizza for his family for the first time. His sister said it was great.","q":"What did Nick do last night?","o":["He washed the dishes.","He made pizza.","He bought pizza.","He went to a restaurant."],"a":2,"j":"he made pizza「ピザを作った」が正解。for the first timeは「初めて」という意味です。"},{"p":"Hana's favorite food is fruit. She eats an apple every morning. On her birthday, her mother makes a big fruit cake for her.","q":"What does Hana eat every morning?","o":["A banana.","An egg.","An apple.","Some bread."],"a":3,"j":"She eats an apple every morning「毎朝りんごを食べる」と言っています。"},{"p":"Welcome to Happy Kitchen. Today's special lunch is fish and soup. It's only eight dollars. We open at eleven every day.","q":"What time does the restaurant open?","o":["At eight.","At nine.","At ten.","At eleven."],"a":4,"j":"We open at eleven「11時に開店します」と言っています。8はランチの値段（8ドル）です。"}]},{"theme":"天気・季節","p1":[{"t":"How's the weather today?","o":["I'm fine.","It's sunny.","It's Tuesday."],"a":2,"j":"「今日の天気はどう？」なので、2番「晴れです」が正解。天気はit'sで答えます。"},{"t":"Which season do you like the best?","o":["It's cold.","Yes, I do.","I like summer."],"a":3,"j":"「どの季節がいちばん好き？」に、3番「夏が好きです」が正解です。seasonは「季節」です。"},{"t":"It's raining. Take your umbrella.","o":["OK, I will.","Me, too.","Nice to meet you."],"a":1,"j":"「雨だからかさを持って行きなさい」に対して、1番「うん、そうする」が自然な返事です。"},{"t":"Was it cold yesterday?","o":["Yes, it's mine.","No, it was warm.","It's December."],"a":2,"j":"「昨日は寒かった？」に、2番「いいえ、あたたかかったよ」が正解。wasはisの過去形です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: It's very hot today.","B: Yes. Let's swim in the pool.","A: Good idea!"],"q":"What will they do?","o":["Swim in the pool.","Watch TV.","Go home.","Drink cold water."],"a":1,"j":"Let's swim in the pool「プールで泳ごう」と言って、Good idea!「いい考えだね」と答えています。"},{"d":["A: Will it be sunny tomorrow?","B: No, it will snow.","A: Really? I have to go out early."],"q":"How will the weather be tomorrow?","o":["Cloudy.","Snowy.","Sunny.","Rainy."],"a":2,"j":"it will snow「雪が降るでしょう」と言っています。"},{"d":["A: Spring is coming soon.","B: Yes. I love the flowers in the park.","A: Let's go and see them next week."],"q":"What season is coming?","o":["Fall.","Winter.","Spring.","Summer."],"a":3,"j":"Spring is coming soon「もうすぐ春が来る」と言っています。"}],"p3":[{"p":"It was rainy last weekend, so Miki stayed home. She read two books and made cookies with her mother. She enjoyed her weekend at home.","q":"Why did Miki stay home?","o":["She had homework.","It was too hot.","She was sick.","It was rainy."],"a":4,"j":"It was rainy「雨だった」ので家にいました。whyは「なぜ」、soは「だから」です。"},{"p":"In Hokkaido, winter is very cold and it snows a lot. Many people visit there to ski. Tomoko went there with her family last February.","q":"When did Tomoko go to Hokkaido?","o":["Last February.","Last summer.","Last December.","Last January."],"a":1,"j":"last February「この前の2月」に行きました。月の名前はよく出るので覚えておきましょう。"},{"p":"Good morning. Here is today's weather. It will be cloudy in the morning, and it will rain in the afternoon. Please take an umbrella with you.","q":"How will the weather be in the afternoon?","o":["Cloudy.","Rainy.","Windy.","Sunny."],"a":2,"j":"it will rain in the afternoon「午後は雨」と言っています。午前はくもりです。"}]},{"theme":"スポーツ","p1":[{"t":"Can you play tennis?","o":["It's a ball.","At the park.","Yes, a little."],"a":3,"j":"「テニスはできる？」に、3番「はい、少し」が正解。a littleは「少し」です。"},{"t":"Let's play soccer after school.","o":["Sorry, I'm busy today.","Here you are.","It was sunny."],"a":1,"j":"「放課後サッカーしようよ」というさそいに、1番「ごめん、今日はいそがしいんだ」が自然な返事です。"},{"t":"How often do you practice baseball?","o":["With my team.","Three times a week.","For two hours."],"a":2,"j":"how oftenは「どのくらいよく」。回数を答えている2番「週に3回」が正解です。"},{"t":"Who is your favorite player?","o":["Basketball.","Last year.","I like Sam Walker."],"a":3,"j":"whoは「だれ」。人の名前を答えている3番が正解です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Did you watch the soccer game last night, Jim?","B: Yes! It was exciting.","A: Our team won!"],"q":"How was the game?","o":["It was sad.","It was boring.","It was exciting.","It was long."],"a":3,"j":"ジムは It was exciting「わくわくした」と言っています。"},{"d":["A: Meg, do you play any sports?","B: Yes, I play volleyball every Saturday.","A: Wow, that's nice."],"q":"When does Meg play volleyball?","o":["Every Sunday.","Every morning.","Every day.","Every Saturday."],"a":4,"j":"every Saturday「毎週土曜日」にバレーボールをしています。"},{"d":["A: I'm going to swim tomorrow. Do you want to come?","B: Sure. Where will we meet?","A: At the station at nine."],"q":"Where will they meet?","o":["At the station.","At the park.","At the pool.","At school."],"a":1,"j":"At the station at nine「9時に駅で」会うことになりました。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Ryo is on the basketball team. He practices every day after school. Next month, his team will have a big game, so he practices hard.","q":"What will happen next month?","o":["Ryo will join a new team.","There will be a big game.","School will end.","Ryo will stop playing."],"a":2,"j":"his team will have a big game「来月大事な試合がある」ので、一生けんめい練習しています。"},{"p":"Last Sunday was the town marathon. About two hundred people ran. Kenta ran with his father, and they finished together.","q":"Who ran with Kenta?","o":["His friend.","His brother.","His father.","His teacher."],"a":3,"j":"Kenta ran with his father「けんたはお父さんと走った」と言っています。ranはrun（走る）の過去形です。"},{"p":"Sara can't swim well, so she goes to swimming school every Friday. Her teacher is kind, and now she can swim twenty-five meters.","q":"How far can Sara swim now?","o":["Fifty meters.","Fifteen meters.","Twenty meters.","Twenty-five meters."],"a":4,"j":"now she can swim twenty-five meters「今は25メートル泳げる」と言っています。"}]},{"theme":"旅行・乗り物","p1":[{"t":"How do you go to the library?","o":["By bike.","Twice a month.","For one hour."],"a":1,"j":"howは「どうやって」。行き方を答えている1番「自転車で」が正解です。by＋乗り物で「〜で」です。"},{"t":"Where are you going this summer?","o":["By plane.","To Okinawa.","Last August."],"a":2,"j":"「この夏はどこへ行くの？」に、行き先を答えている2番「沖縄へ」が正解です。"},{"t":"How long does it take to the airport?","o":["Two tickets.","At the gate.","About one hour."],"a":3,"j":"how longは「どのくらいの時間」。3番「約1時間」が正解です。takeはここでは「（時間が）かかる」です。"},{"t":"Have a nice trip!","o":["Thank you.","Here it is.","That's too bad."],"a":1,"j":"「よい旅行を！」と言われたら、1番「ありがとう」と答えるのが自然です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Excuse me. Does this bus go to the city museum?","B: No. Please take the number five bus.","A: I see. Thank you."],"q":"Which bus goes to the museum?","o":["The number five bus.","The number nine bus.","The number two bus.","The number four bus."],"a":1,"j":"the number five bus「5番のバスに乗ってください」と言っています。"},{"d":["A: Dad, when will we get to Grandpa's house?","B: In about thirty minutes.","A: OK. I'm sleepy."],"q":"When will they get to Grandpa's house?","o":["In thirteen minutes.","In thirty minutes.","In one hour.","Tomorrow."],"a":2,"j":"In about thirty minutes「あと30分くらいで」着きます。thirteen（13）とthirty（30）の聞き分けに注意です。"},{"d":["A: Did you enjoy your trip to Kyoto, Beth?","B: Yes! I saw many old temples.","A: That sounds great."],"q":"What did Beth see in Kyoto?","o":["New buildings.","A famous zoo.","Old temples.","A big lake."],"a":3,"j":"I saw many old temples「たくさんの古いお寺を見た」と言っています。sawはsee（見る）の過去形です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Next week, Taku's class will go to the science museum by train. The students will meet at the station at eight thirty. Taku is very excited.","q":"How will Taku's class go to the museum?","o":["By car.","They will walk.","By bus.","By train."],"a":4,"j":"by train「電車で」行きます。集合は8時30分に駅です。"},{"p":"Thank you for flying with us today. We will arrive in London at two in the afternoon. The weather in London is cloudy now. Please enjoy your flight.","q":"Where is this announcement?","o":["On a plane.","At a station.","On a bus.","On a train."],"a":1,"j":"flying「飛行」やflight「フライト」という言葉から、飛行機の中の放送だとわかります。"},{"p":"Mia's family went camping by a lake last month. Her father drove for three hours. At night, they watched the stars. Mia wants to go again.","q":"How long did Mia's father drive?","o":["For two hours.","For three hours.","For five hours.","For thirty minutes."],"a":2,"j":"drove for three hours「3時間運転した」と言っています。droveはdrive（運転する）の過去形です。"}]},{"theme":"友だち・電話","p1":[{"t":"Hello. This is Mike. Can I speak to Yuki?","o":["It's five hundred yen.","Speaking.","See you soon."],"a":2,"j":"電話で「ユキさんをお願いします」と言われ、本人なら2番 Speaking.「私です」と答えます。電話でよく使う表現です。"},{"t":"What time shall we meet tomorrow?","o":["For three days.","At the bookstore.","How about ten?"],"a":3,"j":"「明日何時に会う？」なので、時間を答えている3番「10時はどう？」が正解です。"},{"t":"I'm sorry, I'm late.","o":["That's all right.","Yes, please.","Good job."],"a":1,"j":"「おくれてごめんなさい」に対して、1番 That's all right.「だいじょうぶだよ」が自然な返事です。"},{"t":"Can you come to my house this afternoon?","o":["It was nice.","Sorry, I can't.","You're welcome."],"a":2,"j":"「今日の午後うちに来られる？」に、2番「ごめん、行けないんだ」が正解。Can you...?にはcanかcan'tで答えます。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Hi, Ken. Let's do our homework together.","B: Sure, Lisa. Where?","A: How about the library?"],"q":"What will Ken and Lisa do?","o":["Watch a movie.","Play games.","Do their homework.","Clean the library."],"a":3,"j":"リサが Let's do our homework together「いっしょに宿題をしよう」とさそっています。"},{"d":["A: Hello?","B: Hi, Anna. This is Bob. Are you free now?","A: Sorry, I'm eating dinner. Can I call you back later?"],"q":"What is Anna doing now?","o":["Taking a bath.","Watching TV.","Doing homework.","Eating dinner."],"a":4,"j":"アンナは I'm eating dinner「夕食を食べているところ」と言っています。call you backは「かけ直す」です。"},{"d":["A: Tom, this is my friend, Yuka.","B: Nice to meet you, Yuka.","A: She just came from Japan."],"q":"Where did Yuka come from?","o":["Japan.","Canada.","China.","America."],"a":1,"j":"She just came from Japan「日本から来たばかり」としょうかいしています。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Jane got a letter from her friend in Australia yesterday. Her friend's name is Emma. They met in London two years ago. Jane will write back tonight.","q":"Where does Emma live?","o":["In Japan.","In Australia.","In America.","In London."],"a":2,"j":"her friend in Australia「オーストラリアにいる友だち」からの手紙です。ロンドンは2人が出会った場所です。"},{"p":"Ken's best friend is Daniel. They became friends five years ago. They like the same music, and they often listen to it together after school.","q":"What do Ken and Daniel do together?","o":["Make videos.","Play soccer.","Listen to music.","Study math."],"a":3,"j":"listen to it together「いっしょに音楽を聞く」と言っています。the same musicは「同じ音楽」です。"},{"p":"Hi, this is Meg. Tomorrow's party will start at four, not three. Please don't forget to bring your camera. See you tomorrow. Bye.","q":"What time will the party start?","o":["At five.","At two.","At three.","At four."],"a":4,"j":"留守番電話のメッセージで at four, not three「3時ではなく4時」と言っています。変更後の時間を聞き取るのがポイントです。"}]},{"theme":"ペット・動物","p1":[{"t":"Do you have any pets?","o":["I like animals.","It's cute.","Yes, I have a dog."],"a":3,"j":"「ペットを飼っている？」に、3番「はい、犬を1ぴき飼っています」が正解です。"},{"t":"What's your cat's name?","o":["Her name is Momo.","I have two cats.","She's two years old."],"a":1,"j":"「ねこの名前は？」なので、名前を答えている1番「モモです」が正解です。"},{"t":"Look at that bird! It's beautiful.","o":["It's mine.","You're right.","I'm hungry."],"a":2,"j":"「あの鳥を見て！きれいだね」に対して、2番 You're right.「本当だね」が自然です。"},{"t":"How old is your dog?","o":["He's big.","He likes balls.","He's three."],"a":3,"j":"how oldは「何さい」。年れいを答えている3番「3さいです」が正解です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Your dog is so cute, Nancy. What's his name?","B: Thanks. His name is Coco.","A: Hi, Coco!"],"q":"What is the dog's name?","o":["Coco.","Choco.","Kiki.","Nancy."],"a":1,"j":"His name is Coco「名前はココです」と言っています。"},{"d":["A: Mom, can we get a cat?","B: No, Jim. Our house is too small.","A: Oh, please!"],"q":"Why can't Jim get a cat?","o":["His mother doesn't like cats.","The house is too small.","He is too young.","Cats are expensive."],"a":2,"j":"お母さんが Our house is too small「うちはせますぎるから」と言っています。"},{"d":["A: I went to the zoo yesterday.","B: Nice! What animal did you like the best?","A: The pandas. They were so cute."],"q":"What animal did the girl like the best?","o":["The lions.","The elephants.","The pandas.","The monkeys."],"a":3,"j":"The pandas.「パンダ」と答えています。the bestは「いちばん」です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Riku has a small white rabbit. Its name is Yuki. Riku gives her vegetables every morning before school. Yuki likes carrots the best.","q":"What does Riku do every morning?","o":["He cleans his room.","He studies English.","He walks his dog.","He gives his rabbit food."],"a":4,"j":"gives her vegetables every morning「毎朝野菜をあげる」と言っています。"},{"p":"Welcome to Green Zoo. The lion show starts at one thirty in front of Lion House. You can also give milk to the baby goats at three. Have fun!","q":"What time does the lion show start?","o":["At one thirty.","At three.","At three thirty.","At one."],"a":1,"j":"The lion show starts at one thirty「ライオンショーは1時30分から」です。3時は子ヤギのミルクの時間です。"},{"p":"Kana's dog, Taro, is ten years old. He can't run fast now, but Kana walks with him in the park every evening. She loves him very much.","q":"When does Kana walk with Taro?","o":["Every afternoon.","Every evening.","Every weekend.","Every morning."],"a":2,"j":"every evening「毎晩」いっしょに公園を歩きます。"}]},{"theme":"誕生日・プレゼント","p1":[{"t":"When is your birthday?","o":["It's May tenth.","I'm thirteen.","At my house."],"a":1,"j":"「誕生日はいつ？」なので、日にちを答えている1番「5月10日です」が正解です。"},{"t":"Happy birthday, Lucy! This is for you.","o":["I'm home.","Thank you so much!","Happy New Year!"],"a":2,"j":"「誕生日おめでとう！これをどうぞ」に、2番「ありがとう！」が自然な返事です。"},{"t":"What do you want for your birthday?","o":["Last Sunday.","At the party.","A new bike."],"a":3,"j":"「誕生日に何がほしい？」に、ほしい物を答えている3番「新しい自転車」が正解です。"},{"t":"Did you enjoy the party?","o":["Yes, it was fun.","No, thank you.","It's next week."],"a":1,"j":"「パーティーは楽しかった？」に、1番「うん、楽しかったよ」が正解。Did you...?にはdidで答えます。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Mary's birthday is next Friday.","B: Let's buy her a present together.","A: Yes! How about a cup?"],"q":"When is Mary's birthday?","o":["Today.","Tomorrow.","Next Friday.","Next Sunday."],"a":3,"j":"Mary's birthday is next Friday「メアリーの誕生日は次の金曜日」と言っています。"},{"d":["A: What did you get for your birthday, Kevin?","B: My father gave me a watch.","A: Wow, it looks nice."],"q":"What did Kevin get?","o":["A phone.","A book.","A camera.","A watch."],"a":4,"j":"gave me a watch「うで時計をくれた」と言っています。gaveはgive（あげる）の過去形です。"},{"d":["A: We need a cake for Dad's birthday.","B: I'll make one, Mom.","A: Really? Thank you, Jenny."],"q":"What will Jenny do?","o":["Make a cake.","Eat a cake.","Order a cake.","Buy a cake."],"a":1,"j":"ジェニーが I'll make one「私が作るよ」と言っています。oneはここではcakeのことです。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Yesterday was Sho's twelfth birthday. His parents took him to an amusement park. At night, they ate dinner at his favorite restaurant. He was very happy.","q":"How old is Sho now?","o":["Eleven.","Twelve.","Thirteen.","Ten."],"a":2,"j":"twelfth birthday「12回目の誕生日」なので、12さいになりました。"},{"p":"Next Saturday is Grandma's birthday. Kumi and her sister will visit her. Kumi will give her flowers, and her sister will give her a scarf.","q":"What will Kumi give her grandmother?","o":["A letter.","A cake.","Flowers.","A scarf."],"a":3,"j":"Kumi will give her flowers「くみは花をあげる」予定です。スカーフをあげるのはお姉さん（妹）です。"},{"p":"Tom wanted a blue bike for his birthday. But his parents gave him a green one. At first he was surprised, but now he likes it very much.","q":"What color bike did Tom get?","o":["Red.","Black.","Blue.","Green."],"a":4,"j":"gave him a green one「緑の自転車をくれた」とあります。ほしかったのは青ですが、もらったのは緑です。"}]},{"theme":"宿題・勉強","p1":[{"t":"Did you finish your math homework?","o":["At school.","Not yet.","Me, too."],"a":2,"j":"「数学の宿題終わった？」に、2番 Not yet.「まだだよ」が正解。よく使う短い返事です。"},{"t":"This question is difficult.","o":["Good morning.","It's cloudy.","I can help you."],"a":3,"j":"「この問題むずかしいね」に対して、3番「手伝ってあげるよ」が自然な返事です。"},{"t":"How many English words do you study every day?","o":["About twenty.","For an hour.","In my room."],"a":1,"j":"how manyは「いくつ」。数を答えている1番「20個くらい」が正解です。"},{"t":"Why are you studying so hard?","o":["With my friends.","Because I have a test tomorrow.","In the library."],"a":2,"j":"whyは「なぜ」。Because「なぜなら」で理由を答えている2番「明日テストがあるから」が正解です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Ted, it's nine. Did you do your homework?","B: I'm doing it now, Mom.","A: OK. Go to bed after that."],"q":"What is Ted doing now?","o":["Doing his homework.","Taking a bath.","Sleeping.","Watching TV."],"a":1,"j":"テッドは I'm doing it now「今やっているところ」と言っています。itは宿題のことです。"},{"d":["A: How was the English test, Aki?","B: It was easy. But the science test was hard.","A: Same for me."],"q":"How was the science test for Aki?","o":["It was easy.","It was hard.","It was short.","It was fun."],"a":2,"j":"the science test was hard「理科のテストはむずかしかった」と言っています。英語はかんたんでした。"},{"d":["A: Can I use your dictionary, Paul?","B: Sure. Here you are.","A: Thanks. I'll give it back soon."],"q":"What does the girl want to use?","o":["A pen.","A notebook.","A dictionary.","A computer."],"a":3,"j":"Can I use your dictionary?「辞書を使ってもいい？」とたのんでいます。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Mei studies English every night. She listens to English songs and writes new words in her notebook. She wants to speak English well.","q":"What does Mei want to do?","o":["Be a music teacher.","Write songs.","Visit America.","Speak English well."],"a":4,"j":"She wants to speak English well「英語を上手に話したい」と言っています。want to〜は「〜したい」です。"},{"p":"OK, class. For homework, please read pages thirty to thirty-five. We will have a small test on Friday. Don't forget. See you tomorrow.","q":"When is the test?","o":["On Friday.","Next week.","Tomorrow.","On Wednesday."],"a":1,"j":"a small test on Friday「金曜日に小テスト」と先生が言っています。読むのは30〜35ページです。"},{"p":"Last night, Jun studied for two hours for today's test. But he was very sleepy this morning and forgot his pencil case. His friend gave him a pencil.","q":"What was Jun's problem this morning?","o":["He was late for school.","He forgot his pencil case.","He lost his notebook.","He didn't study."],"a":2,"j":"forgot his pencil case「筆箱をわすれた」のが問題でした。forgotはforget（わすれる）の過去形です。"}]},{"theme":"料理・手伝い","p1":[{"t":"Can you help me with dinner?","o":["Delicious.","Two eggs.","Sure."],"a":3,"j":"「夕食を手伝ってくれる？」に、3番 Sure.「いいよ」が正解。たのみごとへの返事です。"},{"t":"Please wash the dishes, Ben.","o":["OK, Mom.","Good night.","It's raining."],"a":1,"j":"「お皿を洗ってね」に対して、1番「わかった」が自然な返事です。"},{"t":"What are you making?","o":["In the kitchen.","I'm making a sandwich.","I made it."],"a":2,"j":"「何を作っているの？」に、2番「サンドイッチを作っているよ」が正解。〜ingは「今〜している」です。"},{"t":"Whose turn is it to clean the bath?","o":["In the bathroom.","Every day.","It's Tom's turn."],"a":3,"j":"「おふろそうじはだれの番？」に、3番「トムの番だよ」が正解。turnは「順番」です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Mom, I'm home. Can I have a snack?","B: Yes, but first, please put away your bag.","A: OK."],"q":"What will the boy do first?","o":["Do his homework.","Eat a snack.","Put away his bag.","Wash his hands."],"a":3,"j":"お母さんが first, please put away your bag「まず、かばんを片づけて」と言っています。firstは「まず」です。"},{"d":["A: This curry is really good, Kate. Did you make it?","B: Yes. My grandmother taught me.","A: I want to try making it, too."],"q":"Who taught Kate?","o":["Her friend.","Her mother.","Her teacher.","Her grandmother."],"a":4,"j":"My grandmother taught me「祖母が教えてくれた」と言っています。taughtはteach（教える）の過去形です。"},{"d":["A: Dad, what are you cooking?","B: Fried rice. Lunch will be ready in ten minutes.","A: Great. I'm so hungry."],"q":"When will lunch be ready?","o":["In ten minutes.","In twenty minutes.","In an hour.","In five minutes."],"a":1,"j":"in ten minutes「10分後に」できると言っています。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Every Sunday, Ami helps her mother. Ami cleans the living room, and her brother takes out the garbage. After that, they all have tea together.","q":"What does Ami do every Sunday?","o":["She makes tea.","She cleans the living room.","She takes out the garbage.","She washes the car."],"a":2,"j":"Ami cleans the living room「アミはリビングをそうじする」とあります。ごみ出しは弟（兄）の仕事です。"},{"p":"Tonight, Hiro made miso soup for the first time. He cut the vegetables slowly and carefully. His mother said, \"It's delicious!\" He felt very glad.","q":"What did Hiro make?","o":["Salad.","Curry.","Miso soup.","Cookies."],"a":3,"j":"made miso soup for the first time「初めてみそしるを作った」とあります。"},{"p":"Lisa's family has a rule. Everyone cooks dinner on one day of the week. Lisa's day is Thursday. She usually makes spaghetti because it's easy.","q":"When does Lisa cook dinner?","o":["On Saturdays.","On Mondays.","On Tuesdays.","On Thursdays."],"a":4,"j":"Lisa's day is Thursday「リサの当番は木曜日」です。ruleは「ルール、きまり」です。"}]},{"theme":"音楽・映画","p1":[{"t":"Can you play the piano?","o":["Yes, I can.","I listen to it.","It's a guitar."],"a":1,"j":"「ピアノをひける？」に、1番「はい、ひけます」が正解。Can you...?にはcanで答えます。"},{"t":"Let's go to a movie this Saturday.","o":["It's a camera.","Sounds good.","I watched it."],"a":2,"j":"「今度の土曜日、映画に行こうよ」に、2番 Sounds good.「いいね」が自然な返事です。"},{"t":"What kind of music do you like?","o":["On the radio.","Every night.","I like pop music."],"a":3,"j":"what kind of〜は「どんな種類の〜」。3番「ポップスが好きです」が正解です。"},{"t":"How was the concert last night?","o":["It was wonderful.","It's at seven.","Yes, please."],"a":1,"j":"「昨日のコンサートはどうだった？」に、感想を答えている1番「すばらしかったよ」が正解です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Judy, you sing very well.","B: Thank you. I practice every day after dinner.","A: That's why you're so good."],"q":"When does Judy practice singing?","o":["After dinner.","Before bed.","Before breakfast.","After lunch."],"a":1,"j":"every day after dinner「毎日夕食後に」練習しています。"},{"d":["A: Did you see the new movie about space?","B: Not yet. Is it good?","A: Yes! You should see it."],"q":"What is the movie about?","o":["Animals.","Space.","Sports.","Music."],"a":2,"j":"the new movie about space「宇宙についての新しい映画」と言っています。aboutは「〜について」です。"},{"d":["A: The movie starts at four twenty.","B: It's four now. Let's buy some popcorn.","A: Good idea."],"q":"What time does the movie start?","o":["At two.","At four.","At four twenty.","At four thirty."],"a":3,"j":"starts at four twenty「4時20分に始まる」と言っています。今は4時なので、その前にポップコーンを買います。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Ken plays the guitar in a band with his friends. They practice in Ken's garage every Saturday. Next month, they will play at the school festival.","q":"Where does the band practice?","o":["In a park.","At a music school.","At school.","In Ken's garage."],"a":4,"j":"in Ken's garage「ケンの家のガレージで」練習しています。"},{"p":"Thank you for coming to City Hall tonight. The piano concert will start at six thirty. Please turn off your phones. We hope you enjoy the music.","q":"What should people do?","o":["Turn off their phones.","Stand up.","Sing together.","Buy tickets."],"a":1,"j":"Please turn off your phones「携帯電話の電源を切ってください」というお願いです。turn offは「（電源を）切る」です。"},{"p":"Nina watched a movie about a dog last night. The dog traveled far to meet its family again. Nina cried at the end. She wants to watch it again with her mother.","q":"Why did Nina cry?","o":["She lost her dog.","The movie was sad and moving.","She was sick.","Her mother was angry."],"a":2,"j":"家族に会うために遠くまで旅する犬の映画に感動して、最後に泣きました。"}]},{"theme":"休みの日・時間","p1":[{"t":"What time is it now?","o":["On Sunday.","It's eight fifteen.","For ten minutes."],"a":2,"j":"「今何時？」なので、時刻を答えている2番「8時15分です」が正解です。"},{"t":"What do you usually do on weekends?","o":["Yes, I am.","Next weekend.","I usually read books."],"a":3,"j":"「週末はいつも何をしているの？」に、3番「たいてい本を読みます」が正解。usuallyは「たいてい」です。"},{"t":"Are you free tomorrow afternoon?","o":["Yes, I am.","It was Sunday.","At the mall."],"a":1,"j":"「明日の午後ひま？」に、1番「うん、ひまだよ」が正解。Are you...?にはI amで答えます。"},{"t":"It's time for bed, Lily.","o":["Here you are.","OK. Good night.","Good afternoon."],"a":2,"j":"「リリー、もうねる時間よ」に対して、2番「わかった。おやすみなさい」が自然です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Tomorrow is a holiday! What will you do, Roy?","B: I'll go to the sea with my family.","A: Nice! Have fun."],"q":"What will Roy do tomorrow?","o":["Play video games.","Stay home.","Go to the sea.","Visit his friend."],"a":3,"j":"I'll go to the sea with my family「家族と海に行くよ」と言っています。"},{"d":["A: Meg, hurry up. It's seven forty.","B: Oh no! The bus leaves at seven fifty.","A: Yes. You have only ten minutes."],"q":"What time does the bus leave?","o":["At seven fourteen.","At seven forty.","At seven fifteen.","At seven fifty."],"a":4,"j":"The bus leaves at seven fifty「バスは7時50分に出る」と言っています。今は7時40分なので、あと10分です。"},{"d":["A: I went to bed at eleven last night.","B: That's late, Sam. I go to bed at nine thirty.","A: Wow, that's early."],"q":"What time does the girl go to bed?","o":["At nine thirty.","At ten.","At eleven.","At nine."],"a":1,"j":"女の子は I go to bed at nine thirty「9時30分にねる」と言っています。11時にねたのはサムです。"}],"p3":[{"p":"On holidays, Kota gets up at nine. He eats breakfast slowly and reads comic books. In the afternoon, he rides his bike by the river. He loves quiet holidays.","q":"What does Kota do in the afternoon?","o":["He reads comic books.","He rides his bike.","He watches TV.","He gets up."],"a":2,"j":"In the afternoon, he rides his bike「午後は自転車に乗る」とあります。まんがを読むのは午前中です。"},{"p":"Saki was busy last weekend. On Saturday, she practiced tennis in the morning and went shopping in the afternoon. On Sunday, she visited her aunt.","q":"What did Saki do on Sunday?","o":["She practiced tennis.","She went shopping.","She visited her aunt.","She stayed home."],"a":3,"j":"On Sunday, she visited her aunt「日曜日はおばさんをたずねた」とあります。テニスと買い物は土曜日です。"},{"p":"Attention, please. The city pool will close at five today. It is four thirty now. Please get ready to leave. Thank you.","q":"What time will the pool close?","o":["At five thirty.","At four.","At four thirty.","At five."],"a":4,"j":"will close at five「5時に閉まります」という放送です。今は4時30分です。"}]},{"theme":"町・道案内","p1":[{"t":"Excuse me. Where is the post office?","o":["At two o'clock.","Three stamps, please.","It's next to the bank."],"a":3,"j":"「郵便局はどこですか」に、場所を答えている3番「銀行のとなりです」が正解。next toは「〜のとなり」です。"},{"t":"Is there a hospital near here?","o":["Yes, there is.","No, I'm fine.","It's Monday."],"a":1,"j":"「この近くに病院はありますか」に、1番「はい、あります」が正解。Is there...?にはthere isで答えます。"},{"t":"How can I get to the station?","o":["Two tickets.","Go straight and turn left.","For twenty minutes."],"a":2,"j":"「駅へはどう行けばいいですか」に、道順を答えている2番「まっすぐ行って左に曲がってください」が正解です。"},{"t":"Thank you for your help.","o":["Yes, I can.","That's mine.","You're welcome."],"a":3,"j":"「助けてくれてありがとう」に、3番 You're welcome.「どういたしまして」が正解です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Excuse me. Is the city library near here?","B: Yes. Turn right at that corner. It's in front of the park.","A: Thank you very much."],"q":"Where is the library?","o":["In front of the park.","Behind the school.","Near the hospital.","Next to the station."],"a":1,"j":"It's in front of the park「公園の前にあります」と教えてくれました。in front ofは「〜の前」です。"},{"d":["A: Bob, there's a new bookstore near the station.","B: Really? Let's go there after school.","A: OK!"],"q":"What is near the station?","o":["A new restaurant.","A new bookstore.","A new pool.","A flower shop."],"a":2,"j":"a new bookstore near the station「駅の近くに新しい本屋さん」ができたと言っています。"},{"d":["A: Mom, I'm going to the park.","B: Wait, Jack. It will rain soon. Take your umbrella.","A: OK, I will."],"q":"What will Jack take?","o":["His bag.","His bike.","His umbrella.","His cap."],"a":3,"j":"お母さんに言われて、かさを持って行きます。It will rain soonは「もうすぐ雨が降る」です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"A new flower shop opened in front of Momo Station last week. My mother bought some roses there yesterday. They were beautiful, and the shop staff was very kind.","q":"Where is the new flower shop?","o":["Next to a school.","Inside a supermarket.","In the park.","In front of the station."],"a":4,"j":"in front of Momo Station「モモ駅の前」にオープンしました。"},{"p":"Every Sunday morning, there is a small market in the town square. People sell vegetables, bread, and old books there. Many families enjoy walking around it.","q":"When is the market?","o":["Every Sunday morning.","Every Sunday evening.","Every Saturday morning.","Every Saturday evening."],"a":1,"j":"Every Sunday morning「毎週日曜日の朝」に市場が開かれます。"},{"p":"Taro's town has a tall tower. From the top, you can see the sea and the mountains. It takes about five minutes to the top by elevator.","q":"What can people see from the top of the tower?","o":["A soccer stadium.","The sea and the mountains.","A big lake.","The airport."],"a":2,"j":"you can see the sea and the mountains「海と山が見える」とあります。from the topは「頂上から」です。"}]},{"theme":"体調・病気","p1":[{"t":"What's wrong, Lisa?","o":["I have a headache.","It's a hospital.","You're welcome."],"a":1,"j":"What's wrong?は「どうしたの？」。ぐあいを答えている1番「頭が痛いんです」が正解です。"},{"t":"How are you feeling today?","o":["At the doctor's.","Much better, thank you.","It's sunny."],"a":2,"j":"「今日は気分はどう？」に、2番「だいぶよくなりました、ありがとう」が正解。betterは「よりよい」です。"},{"t":"You should go to bed early tonight.","o":["Yes, it was.","Here it is.","OK, I will."],"a":3,"j":"「今夜は早くねたほうがいいよ」に、3番「うん、そうする」が自然。shouldは「〜したほうがよい」です。"},{"t":"Did you take your medicine?","o":["Yes, after breakfast.","In the kitchen.","It's cold today."],"a":1,"j":"「薬を飲んだ？」に、1番「うん、朝ごはんの後にね」が正解。take medicineで「薬を飲む」です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: You look tired, Ken.","B: I have a cold. I went to the doctor this morning.","A: Please take care."],"q":"What is Ken's problem?","o":["He is late.","He is hungry.","He has a cold.","He lost his key."],"a":3,"j":"ケンは I have a cold「かぜをひいている」と言っています。take careは「お大事に」です。"},{"d":["A: Hello, Ms. Bell. This is Tomoko's mother. Tomoko is sick, so she can't go to school today.","B: I see. I hope she gets well soon.","A: Thank you."],"q":"Why will Tomoko be absent today?","o":["She has a trip.","She got up late.","The school is closed.","She is sick."],"a":4,"j":"お母さんが先生に Tomoko is sick「トモコは病気です」と電話で伝えています。"},{"d":["A: Dad, my tooth hurts.","B: That's bad. Let's go to the dentist this afternoon.","A: OK..."],"q":"Where will they go?","o":["To the dentist.","To a drugstore.","To school.","To a hospital."],"a":1,"j":"歯が痛いので、the dentist「歯医者さん」に行きます。hurtは「痛む」です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Yuji had a fever last night, so he didn't go to school today. He slept a lot and ate some rice soup. Now he feels better and wants to go to school tomorrow.","q":"How does Yuji feel now?","o":["Worse.","Better.","Sleepy.","Hungry."],"a":2,"j":"Now he feels better「今はよくなってきた」とあります。feverは「熱」です。"},{"p":"To keep healthy, my grandfather walks for thirty minutes every morning. He also eats a lot of vegetables and goes to bed at nine thirty. He is eighty, but he is very well.","q":"How long does the grandfather walk every morning?","o":["For ninety minutes.","For thirteen minutes.","For thirty minutes.","For one hour."],"a":3,"j":"walks for thirty minutes「毎朝30分歩く」とあります。healthyは「健康な」です。"},{"p":"Emma didn't eat breakfast this morning. During P.E. class, she felt sick. Her teacher took her to the school nurse. Emma learned that breakfast is important.","q":"What did Emma learn?","o":["P.E. is fun.","She should run fast.","The nurse is kind.","Breakfast is important."],"a":4,"j":"Emma learned that breakfast is important「朝食は大切だと学んだ」とあります。朝食をぬいて体調が悪くなりました。"}]},{"theme":"図書館・本","p1":[{"t":"How many books can I borrow?","o":["On the second floor.","Up to five.","For two weeks."],"a":2,"j":"「何冊借りられますか」に、数を答えている2番「5冊まで」が正解。borrowは「借りる」です。"},{"t":"Do you often come to this library?","o":["It's a big library.","I read it.","Yes, every weekend."],"a":3,"j":"「この図書館によく来るの？」に、3番「うん、毎週末ね」が正解です。"},{"t":"What are you reading?","o":["A book about stars.","In the library.","Yes, I do."],"a":1,"j":"「何を読んでいるの？」に、1番「星についての本だよ」が正解です。"},{"t":"Please be quiet in the library.","o":["Good idea.","Oh, I'm sorry.","Yes, please."],"a":2,"j":"「図書館では静かにしてください」と注意されたので、2番「あ、すみません」が自然です。quietは「静かな」です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Excuse me. I want to return these books.","B: Sure. Oh, this one is late.","A: I'm very sorry."],"q":"What is the girl doing?","o":["Returning books.","Reading books.","Looking for books.","Buying books."],"a":1,"j":"I want to return these books「本を返したいのですが」と言っています。returnは「返す」です。"},{"d":["A: Dan, this story was really interesting.","B: I know. I read it three times.","A: Wow, three times!"],"q":"How many times did Dan read the story?","o":["Two times.","Three times.","Five times.","One time."],"a":2,"j":"I read it three times「3回読んだ」と言っています。〜timesは「〜回」です。"},{"d":["A: Where are the animal books?","B: They're on the third floor, next to the science books.","A: Thank you."],"q":"Where are the animal books?","o":["On the first floor.","On the second floor.","On the third floor.","Near the door."],"a":3,"j":"on the third floor「3階」にあります。floorは「階」です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Ruri goes to the city library every Saturday. Last week, she found an interesting book about pandas. She wrote about it for her school homework.","q":"What was the book about?","o":["Flowers.","Trains.","Birds.","Pandas."],"a":4,"j":"an interesting book about pandas「パンダについてのおもしろい本」を見つけました。"},{"p":"This library will be closed next Monday and Tuesday. Please return your books by this Sunday. You can also use the book box at night. Thank you.","q":"When will the library be closed?","o":["Next Monday and Tuesday.","Next weekend.","Every night.","This Sunday."],"a":1,"j":"closed next Monday and Tuesday「来週の月曜と火曜が休館」というお知らせです。返却はこの日曜日までです。"},{"p":"Haruto doesn't like reading, but yesterday his friend gave him a comic book about a soccer player. Haruto read it in one day. Now he wants to read the next one.","q":"What does Haruto want to do now?","o":["Play soccer.","Read the next book.","Watch a game.","Write a comic."],"a":2,"j":"he wants to read the next one「続きが読みたい」と思っています。読書ぎらいでしたが、1日で読み切りました。"}]},{"theme":"夏休み","p1":[{"t":"How was your summer vacation?","o":["It's hot today.","Yes, I am.","It was great."],"a":3,"j":"「夏休みはどうだった？」に、感想を答えている3番「最高だったよ」が正解です。"},{"t":"What did you do during the vacation?","o":["I visited my grandparents.","Next August.","For five days."],"a":1,"j":"「休みの間、何をしたの？」に、1番「祖父母をたずねました」が正解。duringは「〜の間」です。"},{"t":"Are you going anywhere this summer?","o":["Every day.","Yes, to the mountains.","It was fun."],"a":2,"j":"「この夏どこかへ行くの？」に、2番「うん、山へ行くよ」が正解です。"},{"t":"When does summer vacation start?","o":["At the beach.","With my family.","Next Friday."],"a":3,"j":"whenは「いつ」。時を答えている3番「次の金曜日」が正解です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Guess what! I went to Hawaii this summer.","B: Wow, Amy! How long did you stay?","A: For one week."],"q":"How long did Amy stay in Hawaii?","o":["For three days.","For five days.","For one week.","For one month."],"a":3,"j":"For one week.「1週間です」と答えています。how longは「どのくらいの間」です。"},{"d":["A: Did you finish your summer homework, Leo?","B: Almost. I only have the book report.","A: You have three more days. Good luck."],"q":"What homework does Leo have now?","o":["A science project.","English words.","Math questions.","The book report."],"a":4,"j":"I only have the book report「残りは読書感想文だけ」と言っています。almostは「ほとんど」です。"},{"d":["A: The summer festival is tonight!","B: Yes! Let's watch the fireworks together.","A: They start at seven thirty."],"q":"What will they watch tonight?","o":["Fireworks.","The stars.","A movie.","A soccer game."],"a":1,"j":"Let's watch the fireworks「花火を見よう」と言っています。fireworksは「花火」です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Last summer, Shota joined a camp for three days. He cooked outside and swam in the river. On the last night, everyone sat around the fire and sang songs.","q":"How long was the camp?","o":["Two days.","Three days.","Five days.","One week."],"a":2,"j":"a camp for three days「3日間のキャンプ」に参加しました。"},{"p":"Rin stayed at her uncle's house by the sea for a week. Every morning, she walked on the beach and picked up pretty shells. She will give them to her friends.","q":"What did Rin do every morning?","o":["She played with her friends.","She swam in the sea.","She walked on the beach.","She cooked breakfast."],"a":3,"j":"walked on the beach and picked up shells「浜辺を歩いて貝がらを拾った」とあります。"},{"p":"Hello, everyone. Tomorrow, we will go to the lake. The bus will leave the hotel at nine. Please bring your hat and a drink. Don't be late.","q":"What time will the bus leave?","o":["At ten.","At seven.","At eight.","At nine."],"a":4,"j":"The bus will leave the hotel at nine「バスは9時にホテルを出発します」というお知らせです。"}]},{"theme":"服・色","p1":[{"t":"Which cap is yours?","o":["The blue one.","Yes, it is.","It's sunny."],"a":1,"j":"「どちらのぼうしがあなたの？」に、1番 The blue one.「青いほうです」が正解。oneはcapのことです。"},{"t":"You look nice in that sweater.","o":["It's snowing.","Thank you.","Me, too."],"a":2,"j":"「そのセーター、似合うね」とほめられたら、2番「ありがとう」と答えます。"},{"t":"May I try on this jacket?","o":["It's five o'clock.","I like shopping.","Sure. This way, please."],"a":3,"j":"「このジャケットを試着してもいいですか」に、店員の3番「もちろんです。こちらへどうぞ」が正解。try onは「試着する」です。"},{"t":"What color do you like?","o":["I like yellow.","A small size.","Two shirts."],"a":1,"j":"「何色が好き？」に、色を答えている1番「黄色が好きです」が正解です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Mom, where is my white shirt?","B: It's still wet, Tim. How about the gray one?","A: OK, I'll wear that."],"q":"Which shirt will Tim wear?","o":["The gray one.","The blue one.","The black one.","The white one."],"a":1,"j":"白いシャツはまだぬれているので、the gray one「グレーのシャツ」を着ます。wetは「ぬれた」です。"},{"d":["A: This red skirt is cute. But it's a little small.","B: We have a bigger size. One moment, please.","A: Thank you."],"q":"What is the girl's problem?","o":["The skirt is too big.","The skirt is a little small.","The color is not good.","The skirt is expensive."],"a":2,"j":"it's a little small「少し小さい」のが問題です。店員さんが大きいサイズを持ってきてくれます。"},{"d":["A: It's cold outside, Ken.","B: OK, Mom. I'll take my coat.","A: And don't forget your gloves."],"q":"What will Ken take?","o":["His umbrella.","His sweater.","His coat and gloves.","His cap and coat."],"a":3,"j":"コートを持って行き、お母さんに「手ぶくろもわすれないで」と言われました。glovesは「手ぶくろ」です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Nana made a bag in her home economics class. It is green and has a pocket. She uses it every day for her lunch box. Her friends say it's pretty.","q":"What did Nana make?","o":["A lunch box.","A pocket.","A skirt.","A bag."],"a":4,"j":"made a bag「かばんを作った」とあります。緑色でポケットつきです。"},{"p":"Thank you for shopping at Star Clothes. Today, all winter coats are thirty percent off. Sweaters are on the second floor. We close at eight tonight.","q":"What is thirty percent off today?","o":["All winter coats.","All shirts.","All shoes.","All sweaters."],"a":1,"j":"all winter coats are thirty percent off「冬物コート全品30％引き」という店内放送です。"},{"p":"Tomorrow is the school picture day. Students don't wear school uniforms on that day. Mika will wear her favorite pink dress. She washed it today.","q":"What will Mika wear tomorrow?","o":["Her school uniform.","A pink dress.","A white shirt.","A blue skirt."],"a":2,"j":"her favorite pink dress「お気に入りのピンクのワンピース」を着る予定です。uniformは「制服」です。"}]},{"theme":"部活・クラブ","p1":[{"t":"What club are you in?","o":["Yes, I do.","I'm in the tennis club.","After school."],"a":2,"j":"「何部に入っているの？」に、2番「テニス部です」が正解。be in the 〜 clubで「〜部に入っている」です。"},{"t":"Why were you late for practice?","o":["At four o'clock.","It was fun.","Because I missed the bus."],"a":3,"j":"whyは「なぜ」。3番「バスに乗りおくれたから」が正解。missedは「乗りそこねた」です。"},{"t":"Our team won the game!","o":["That's great!","I'm sorry.","No, thank you."],"a":1,"j":"「うちのチームが試合に勝ったよ！」といううれしい知らせには、1番「すごいね！」が自然です。wonはwin（勝つ）の過去形です。"},{"t":"Do you have club activities today?","o":["Two hours ago.","No, not today.","In the gym."],"a":2,"j":"「今日は部活あるの？」に、2番「ううん、今日はないよ」が正解です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Nick, are you going to join a club?","B: Yes, the art club. I love drawing.","A: That's perfect for you."],"q":"Which club will Nick join?","o":["The English club.","The music club.","The art club.","The soccer club."],"a":3,"j":"the art club. I love drawing「美術部だよ。絵を描くのが大好きなんだ」と言っています。"},{"d":["A: Where is your brass band practice?","B: Usually in the music room. But today, it's in the gym.","A: I see."],"q":"Where will the band practice today?","o":["In the classroom.","Outside.","In the music room.","In the gym."],"a":4,"j":"today, it's in the gym「今日は体育館」です。いつもは音楽室ですが、今日はちがいます。"},{"d":["A: You look happy, Miki.","B: Our volleyball team will play in the city games next month!","A: Wow, congratulations!"],"q":"Why is Miki happy?","o":["Her team will play in the city games.","She won a race.","She made a new friend.","She got a present."],"a":1,"j":"チームが市の大会に出ることになったので、うれしいのです。congratulationsは「おめでとう」です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Kaito is in the cooking club. The members meet every Wednesday and make dishes from different countries. Last week, they made pizza from Italy.","q":"When does the cooking club meet?","o":["Every Monday.","Every Wednesday.","Every Friday.","Every weekend."],"a":2,"j":"meet every Wednesday「毎週水曜日に集まる」とあります。先週はイタリアのピザを作りました。"},{"p":"Hi, everyone. The tennis club will not practice this Thursday because of the school event. We will practice on Friday morning instead. Please come at seven thirty.","q":"When will the club practice instead?","o":["On Thursday morning.","On Thursday evening.","On Friday morning.","On Saturday."],"a":3,"j":"on Friday morning instead「代わりに金曜日の朝に」練習します。insteadは「その代わりに」です。"},{"p":"Momoka joined the English club in April. At first, she was too shy to speak. But the members were friendly, and now she enjoys talking in English every week.","q":"How was Momoka at first?","o":["She spoke English well.","She was not interested.","She was often late.","She was too shy to speak."],"a":4,"j":"At first, she was too shy to speak「初めははずかしくて話せなかった」とあります。今は毎週楽しく話しています。"}]},{"theme":"一日の生活","p1":[{"t":"What time do you get up?","o":["In my bed.","For eight hours.","At six thirty."],"a":3,"j":"「何時に起きるの？」に、時刻を答えている3番「6時30分に」が正解。get upは「起きる」です。"},{"t":"Breakfast is ready!","o":["I'm coming!","Good night.","See you tomorrow."],"a":1,"j":"「朝ごはんできたよ！」とよばれたら、1番 I'm coming!「今行く！」が自然な返事です。"},{"t":"Did you brush your teeth?","o":["At the table.","Yes, I did.","It's my toothbrush."],"a":2,"j":"「歯みがきした？」に、2番「うん、したよ」が正解。Did you...?にはdidで答えます。"},{"t":"Hurry up, or you'll miss the train.","o":["You're welcome.","It was delicious.","OK, I'm ready now."],"a":3,"j":"「急がないと電車に乗りおくれるよ」に、3番「わかった、もう準備できたよ」が自然です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Bill, wake up! It's seven twenty.","B: Oh no! School starts at eight!","A: Your breakfast is on the table."],"q":"What time does school start?","o":["At eight.","At eight twenty.","At seven.","At seven twenty."],"a":1,"j":"School starts at eight!「学校は8時に始まる！」と言っています。今は7時20分です。"},{"d":["A: I walk my dog every morning before breakfast.","B: Every morning? That's nice, Jun.","A: Yes, it makes me hungry!"],"q":"What does Jun do before breakfast?","o":["He runs alone.","He walks his dog.","He reads a paper.","He makes breakfast."],"a":2,"j":"I walk my dog every morning「毎朝犬の散歩をする」と言っています。walkはここでは「散歩させる」です。"},{"d":["A: I'm home, Mom.","B: Welcome back. Wash your hands, and then have some snacks.","A: OK!"],"q":"What will the boy do first?","o":["Eat snacks.","Do homework.","Wash his hands.","Watch TV."],"a":3,"j":"Wash your hands, and then...「手を洗って、それから」と言われたので、まず手を洗います。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Ichiro gets up at six every day. He runs in the park for twenty minutes before breakfast. Because of this, he is never sleepy in class.","q":"What does Ichiro do before breakfast?","o":["He watches TV.","He studies English.","He makes his bed.","He runs in the park."],"a":4,"j":"runs in the park for twenty minutes「公園で20分走る」とあります。だから授業中ねむくなりません。"},{"p":"Mari usually takes a bath at nine and goes to bed at ten. Before sleeping, she reads a book for a while. She thinks this is the best time of the day.","q":"What does Mari do before sleeping?","o":["She reads a book.","She listens to music.","She drinks milk.","She takes a bath."],"a":1,"j":"Before sleeping, she reads a book「ねる前に本を読む」とあります。おふろは9時です。"},{"p":"This morning, Kenji got up late. He didn't have time for breakfast, so his mother gave him a small rice ball. He ate it and ran to the bus stop.","q":"Why didn't Kenji eat breakfast at home?","o":["He wasn't hungry.","He got up late.","There was no food.","He was sick."],"a":2,"j":"got up late「ねぼうした」ので朝ごはんの時間がありませんでした。お母さんが小さいおにぎりをくれました。"}]},{"theme":"公園・遊び","p1":[{"t":"Let's take a walk in the park.","o":["Good idea.","I took it.","It's a nice park."],"a":1,"j":"「公園を散歩しようよ」というさそいに、1番 Good idea.「いい考えだね」が自然な返事です。"},{"t":"Whose ball is that under the bench?","o":["Yes, let's.","Maybe it's Jim's.","On the bench."],"a":2,"j":"whoseは「だれの」。2番「たぶんジムのだよ」が正解。maybeは「たぶん」です。"},{"t":"Can I ride your bike?","o":["By bus.","It's far from here.","Sure, but be careful."],"a":3,"j":"「自転車に乗ってもいい？」に、3番「いいよ、でも気をつけてね」が正解。be carefulは「気をつけて」です。"},{"t":"What a beautiful garden!","o":["Yes, I love these flowers.","I'm fine, thank you.","It's next Sunday."],"a":1,"j":"「なんてきれいな庭でしょう！」に、1番「うん、この花たちが大好きなの」が自然です。What a 〜!は「なんて〜だ！」です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Dad, can we fly a kite in the park?","B: Sure. It's windy today, so it's perfect.","A: Yay! Let's go!"],"q":"How is the weather today?","o":["Rainy.","Snowy.","Windy.","Hot."],"a":3,"j":"It's windy today「今日は風が強い」ので、たこあげにぴったりです。kiteは「たこ」です。"},{"d":["A: Where's your little brother, Ken?","B: He's playing in the sandbox over there.","A: Oh, I see him."],"q":"Where is Ken's brother?","o":["On the swing.","At home.","By the pond.","In the sandbox."],"a":4,"j":"playing in the sandbox「砂場で遊んでいる」と言っています。"},{"d":["A: I found a four-leaf clover!","B: Really, Yumi? You're lucky!","A: I'll put it in my notebook."],"q":"What did Yumi find?","o":["A four-leaf clover.","A coin.","A little bird.","A pretty stone."],"a":1,"j":"a four-leaf clover「四つ葉のクローバー」を見つけました。luckyは「運がいい」です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"There is a big park near Kenta's house. It has a long slide and a fountain. In summer, children play in the water. Kenta goes there with his friends after school.","q":"What do children do in the park in summer?","o":["They ski.","They play in the water.","They study.","They ride horses."],"a":2,"j":"children play in the water「子どもたちは水遊びをする」とあります。fountainは「ふん水」です。"},{"p":"Last Saturday, Miku and her friends had a picnic in the park. They ate sandwiches under a big tree. After lunch, they played badminton. It was a fun day.","q":"What did Miku and her friends do after lunch?","o":["They took photos.","They went home.","They played badminton.","They made sandwiches."],"a":3,"j":"After lunch, they played badminton「昼食後、バドミントンをした」とあります。"},{"p":"Attention, park visitors. Please don't feed the birds by the pond. Also, please put your garbage in the garbage boxes. Let's keep our park clean. Thank you.","q":"What is this announcement about?","o":["A lost child.","A special event.","The weather.","Park rules."],"a":4,"j":"「鳥にえさをあげないで」「ごみはごみ箱へ」という公園のルールについての放送です。feedは「えさをやる」です。"}]},{"theme":"先生・授業","p1":[{"t":"Open your textbooks to page forty.","o":["It's forty dollars.","Yes, Mr. Smith.","Good night."],"a":2,"j":"先生の「教科書の40ページを開いて」という指示に、2番「はい、スミス先生」が自然です。"},{"t":"Who is your English teacher?","o":["English is fun.","In the classroom.","Ms. Brown."],"a":3,"j":"whoは「だれ」。先生の名前を答えている3番「ブラウン先生です」が正解です。"},{"t":"May I go to the bathroom?","o":["Sure, go ahead.","It's clean.","I did it."],"a":1,"j":"「トイレに行ってもいいですか」に、1番「いいですよ、どうぞ」が正解。go aheadは「どうぞ」です。"},{"t":"What did you learn in science today?","o":["Ms. Ito.","We learned about plants.","I like science."],"a":2,"j":"「今日の理科で何を勉強したの？」に、内容を答えている2番「植物について学んだよ」が正解です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Ms. Hill, I can't find my notebook.","B: Look in the lost and found box, Peter.","A: Oh, I'll check it."],"q":"What is Peter's problem?","o":["He can't find his notebook.","He forgot his homework.","He lost his money.","He is late."],"a":1,"j":"I can't find my notebook「ノートが見つからない」と先生に相談しています。lost and foundは「落とし物」です。"},{"d":["A: We'll have a new student from Canada next week.","B: Really, Mr. Sato? Boy or girl?","A: A girl. Her name is Amy."],"q":"Where is the new student from?","o":["Australia.","Canada.","England.","America."],"a":2,"j":"a new student from Canada「カナダから来る新しい生徒」と先生が言っています。"},{"d":["A: Kumi, your speech was wonderful.","B: Thank you, Mr. Jones. I practiced a lot.","A: Your English is getting better."],"q":"Why was Kumi's speech good?","o":["The topic was easy.","It was short.","She practiced a lot.","Her voice was big."],"a":3,"j":"I practiced a lot「たくさん練習しました」と言っています。get betterは「上手になる」です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"In art class today, the students drew pictures of their favorite places. Sota drew the sea because he loves fishing with his father. His teacher liked his picture.","q":"What did Sota draw?","o":["His house.","A mountain.","His school.","The sea."],"a":4,"j":"Sota drew the sea「そうたは海を描いた」とあります。drewはdraw（描く）の過去形です。"},{"p":"Mr. King is an English teacher from London. He came to Japan two years ago. He likes Japanese food, and his favorite is tempura. He often talks about it in class.","q":"When did Mr. King come to Japan?","o":["Two years ago.","Three years ago.","Ten years ago.","Last year."],"a":1,"j":"came to Japan two years ago「2年前に日本に来た」とあります。〜agoは「〜前」です。"},{"p":"Good morning, class. Today, we will have lunch early because of the afternoon school trip. Lunch will start at eleven thirty. Please get ready quickly.","q":"Why will they have lunch early?","o":["Because of a meeting.","Because of a school trip.","Because of a test.","Because of the rain."],"a":2,"j":"because of the afternoon school trip「午後の校外学習があるから」早めに昼食をとります。because ofは「〜のために」です。"}]},{"theme":"祖父母・訪問","p1":[{"t":"How often do you visit your grandparents?","o":["By car.","They are kind.","About once a month."],"a":3,"j":"how oftenは「どのくらいよく」。回数を答えている3番「月に1回くらい」が正解。once a monthは「月に1回」です。"},{"t":"Please come in.","o":["Thank you.","I'm coming home.","It's near here."],"a":1,"j":"「どうぞお入りください」に、1番「ありがとうございます」が自然です。"},{"t":"Would you like some tea?","o":["I made it.","Yes, please.","Here you are."],"a":2,"j":"「お茶はいかがですか」に、2番「はい、おねがいします」が正解。Would you like〜?は「〜はいかがですか」です。"},{"t":"Say hello to your grandmother.","o":["Hello, everyone.","She is fine.","OK, I will."],"a":3,"j":"「おばあさんによろしくね」に、3番「うん、伝えるね」が正解。say hello toは「〜によろしく」です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Grandpa, what's this old picture?","B: That's me! I was a baseball player.","A: Wow, really? Cool!"],"q":"What was the grandfather?","o":["A singer.","A teacher.","A baseball player.","A doctor."],"a":3,"j":"I was a baseball player「野球選手だったんだよ」と言っています。wasはamの過去形です。"},{"d":["A: Grandma, I'll carry your bag.","B: Oh, thank you, Yuto. You're so kind.","A: It's heavy! What's in it?"],"q":"What will Yuto do?","o":["Buy a bag.","Clean the room.","Open the door.","Carry the bag."],"a":4,"j":"I'll carry your bag「ぼくがかばんを持つよ」と言っています。carryは「運ぶ」、heavyは「重い」です。"},{"d":["A: Did you call Grandma, Ken?","B: Yes, Mom. She was happy to hear my voice.","A: Good. Her birthday is coming soon."],"q":"How did Grandma feel?","o":["She was happy.","She was sleepy.","She was busy.","She was sad."],"a":1,"j":"She was happy to hear my voice「ぼくの声を聞いてよろこんでいた」と言っています。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Kazu's grandfather has a vegetable garden. Kazu visited him last weekend and picked tomatoes together. His grandfather gave him a big bag of vegetables to take home.","q":"What did Kazu do last weekend?","o":["He planted flowers.","He picked tomatoes.","He cooked dinner.","He cleaned the garden."],"a":2,"j":"picked tomatoes together「いっしょにトマトをつんだ」とあります。pickは「つみ取る」です。"},{"p":"My grandmother is seventy-five. She takes a computer class every Tuesday because she wants to send e-mails to me. Yesterday, I got her first e-mail. I was moved.","q":"Why does the grandmother take a computer class?","o":["Her friend asked her.","She wants to work.","She wants to send e-mails.","She wants to make games."],"a":3,"j":"she wants to send e-mails「メールを送りたいから」パソコン教室に通っています。75さいでちょうせんしています。"},{"p":"Next month, Sara's grandparents will come to her house and stay for five days. Sara is planning to take them to the new aquarium. She wants to see the dolphins with them.","q":"Where will Sara take her grandparents?","o":["To a museum.","To a zoo.","To the mountains.","To the new aquarium."],"a":4,"j":"take them to the new aquarium「新しい水族館に連れて行く」計画です。aquariumは「水族館」です。"}]},{"theme":"海・山・自然","p1":[{"t":"Have you ever seen the sea?","o":["Yes, many times.","It's salty.","I can swim."],"a":1,"j":"「海を見たことある？」に、1番「うん、何回もあるよ」が正解。many timesは「何回も」です。"},{"t":"Look! There's a rainbow!","o":["It's mine.","Wow, it's beautiful!","I'm sorry."],"a":2,"j":"「見て！にじが出てるよ！」に、2番「わあ、きれい！」が自然な返事です。rainbowは「にじ」です。"},{"t":"Which is higher, Mt. Aso or Mt. Fuji?","o":["Yes, it is.","I climbed it.","Mt. Fuji is."],"a":3,"j":"「阿蘇山と富士山、どちらが高い？」に、3番「富士山です」が正解。higherは「より高い」という比較の形です。"},{"t":"Don't swim in this river.","o":["OK, I won't.","Yes, I did.","It's cold water."],"a":1,"j":"「この川で泳いではいけません」に、1番「わかりました、泳ぎません」が正解。won'tはwill notの短い形です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: I went to the beach yesterday.","B: Nice! Did you swim, Mika?","A: No, it was cold. I just walked and took pictures."],"q":"What did Mika do at the beach?","o":["She walked and took pictures.","She played volleyball.","She caught fish.","She swam."],"a":1,"j":"I just walked and took pictures「歩いて写真をとっただけ」と言っています。寒くて泳ぎませんでした。"},{"d":["A: Dad, how tall is that mountain?","B: About two thousand meters.","A: Wow! Can we climb it?"],"q":"How tall is the mountain?","o":["About two hundred meters.","About two thousand meters.","About twelve thousand meters.","About twenty meters."],"a":2,"j":"About two thousand meters「約2000メートル」です。hundred（100）とthousand（1000）の聞き分けがポイントです。"},{"d":["A: Let's go camping next month.","B: Great! I'll bring my new tent.","A: Then I'll bring food and drinks."],"q":"What will the boy bring?","o":["A map.","Chairs.","A tent.","Food and drinks."],"a":3,"j":"最初の男の子が I'll bring my new tent「新しいテントを持って行く」と言っています。食べ物を持って行くのは相手です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Mt. Midori is a popular mountain in our town. In fall, many people climb it to see the red and yellow leaves. From the top, you can see the whole town.","q":"Why do many people climb Mt. Midori in fall?","o":["To see birds.","To take a class.","To pick fruit.","To see the leaves."],"a":4,"j":"to see the red and yellow leaves「紅葉を見るために」登ります。to〜は「〜するために」です。"},{"p":"Last Sunday, Ken's family went to the river. Ken and his brother caught five small fish. Their mother cooked them for dinner. They were delicious.","q":"How many fish did Ken and his brother catch?","o":["Five.","Two.","Three.","Four."],"a":1,"j":"caught five small fish「小さい魚を5ひきつかまえた」とあります。caughtはcatch（つかまえる）の過去形です。"},{"p":"Welcome to Blue Sea Boat Tour. This tour is about fifty minutes. You can see many fish from the boat. Sometimes, we can see dolphins, too. Please enjoy.","q":"How long is the boat tour?","o":["About thirty minutes.","About fifty minutes.","About ninety minutes.","About fifteen minutes."],"a":2,"j":"about fifty minutes「約50分」のツアーです。fifteen（15）とfifty（50）の聞き分けに注意しましょう。"}]},{"theme":"スーパー・値段","p1":[{"t":"That's six dollars fifty, please.","o":["I'm home.","Here you are.","You're welcome."],"a":2,"j":"「6ドル50セントです」とお金をはらう場面なので、2番 Here you are.「はい、どうぞ」が正解です。"},{"t":"Do you need a bag?","o":["It's a nice bag.","Three, please.","No, thank you."],"a":3,"j":"「ふくろはいりますか」に、3番「いいえ、けっこうです」が正解です。"},{"t":"Which is cheaper, this one or that one?","o":["That one is.","Yes, it is.","I'll take both."],"a":1,"j":"「どちらが安いですか」に、1番「そちらのほうです」が正解。cheaperは「より安い」という比較の形です。"},{"t":"How many apples do we need?","o":["In the kitchen.","Four is enough.","They're sweet."],"a":2,"j":"「りんごはいくつ必要？」に、数を答えている2番「4つで十分だよ」が正解。enoughは「十分」です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Mom, can we buy this chocolate?","B: You already have snacks at home, Taku.","A: But this is my favorite..."],"q":"What does Taku want to buy?","o":["Juice.","Cookies.","Chocolate.","Ice cream."],"a":3,"j":"can we buy this chocolate?「このチョコを買ってもいい？」とお願いしています。alreadyは「もう、すでに」です。"},{"d":["A: Excuse me. How much are these eggs?","B: They're two dollars twenty.","A: OK, I'll take two boxes."],"q":"How many boxes will the woman buy?","o":["Three.","Four.","One.","Two."],"a":4,"j":"I'll take two boxes「2パックください」と言っています。値段は2ドル20セントです。"},{"d":["A: We need milk, bread, and eggs.","B: Dad, they don't have any bread today.","A: Really? Then let's get rice."],"q":"What will they get instead of bread?","o":["Rice.","Butter.","Milk.","Eggs."],"a":1,"j":"パンが売り切れだったので、let's get rice「お米にしよう」と言っています。instead ofは「〜の代わりに」です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Every Friday, Ai's father buys food for the weekend at the supermarket. Ai often goes with him because he sometimes buys her ice cream. It's their little secret.","q":"When does Ai's father go to the supermarket?","o":["Every Wednesday.","Every Friday.","Every Saturday.","Every Sunday."],"a":2,"j":"Every Friday「毎週金曜日」に週末の食料を買いに行きます。secretは「ひみつ」です。"},{"p":"Thank you for shopping at Fresh Mart. It's five fifty now. We will close at six today. Please bring everything to the register. Thank you.","q":"What time will the store close today?","o":["At five thirty.","At five fifty.","At six.","At five."],"a":3,"j":"We will close at six「6時に閉店します」という放送です。今の時刻が5時50分です。"},{"p":"Rice balls at Sun Store are usually one dollar twenty, but after seven at night, they are half price. Ted often buys them after his soccer practice.","q":"When are the rice balls half price?","o":["On weekends.","In the morning.","At lunch time.","After seven at night."],"a":4,"j":"after seven at night「夜7時以降」に半額になります。half priceは「半額」です。"}]},{"theme":"冬・年末年始","p1":[{"t":"It's snowing outside!","o":["Yes, it's hot.","I like spring.","Really? Let's make a snowman!"],"a":3,"j":"「外は雪が降ってるよ！」に、3番「ほんと？雪だるまを作ろう！」が自然な返事です。snowmanは「雪だるま」です。"},{"t":"Happy New Year!","o":["Happy New Year! ","Happy birthday!","Good luck."],"a":1,"j":"「あけましておめでとう！」には、同じく1番「あけましておめでとう！」と返します。"},{"t":"What did you do during the winter vacation?","o":["Next January.","I went skiing.","It was cold."],"a":2,"j":"「冬休みは何をしたの？」に、したことを答えている2番「スキーに行ったよ」が正解です。"},{"t":"Close the window, please. It's cold.","o":["It's open.","I'm cold, too","Sure."],"a":3,"j":"「窓を閉めてください。寒いので」というお願いに、3番 Sure.「いいですよ」が正解です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Dad, when will we visit the shrine?","B: On January first, in the morning.","A: I'll get up early!"],"q":"When will they visit the shrine?","o":["On January first.","On January second.","Next weekend.","On December thirty-first."],"a":1,"j":"On January first, in the morning「1月1日の朝」に行きます。shrineは「神社」です。"},{"d":["A: Look at my new gloves. My aunt sent them to me.","B: They look warm, Yuki.","A: Yes, I love them."],"q":"Who sent the gloves to Yuki?","o":["Her mother.","Her aunt.","Her friend.","Her sister."],"a":2,"j":"My aunt sent them「おばが送ってくれた」と言っています。sentはsend（送る）の過去形です。"},{"d":["A: Did you see the snow this morning?","B: Yes! My school was closed today.","A: Lucky you! Mine wasn't."],"q":"Why was the boy lucky?","o":["He saw his friend.","He got a present.","His school was closed.","He won a game."],"a":3,"j":"雪で My school was closed「学校が休みになった」からです。Lucky you!は「いいなあ！」です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"In December, Yui's family cleans the whole house together. Yui cleans the windows every year. After cleaning, they eat hot noodles. Yui likes this family event.","q":"What does Yui clean every year?","o":["The garden.","The kitchen.","The bath.","The windows."],"a":4,"j":"Yui cleans the windows「ユイは窓をそうじする」とあります。年末の大そうじの話です。"},{"p":"Last winter, Hayato went skiing for the first time. He fell down many times on the first day. But on the last day, he skied down from the top of the mountain.","q":"What did Hayato do on the last day?","o":["He skied from the top.","He stayed in the hotel.","He made a snowman.","He fell down many times."],"a":1,"j":"on the last day, he skied down from the top「最終日には頂上からすべり下りた」とあります。fell downは「転んだ」です。"},{"p":"On New Year's Day, Nao got some money from her grandparents. She wants to buy a new watch, but she will also save some money for the future.","q":"What does Nao want to buy?","o":["A new bag.","A new watch.","Some books.","A present for her friend."],"a":2,"j":"She wants to buy a new watch「新しいうで時計を買いたい」とあります。saveは「貯金する」です。"}]},{"theme":"将来・夢","p1":[{"t":"What do you want to be in the future?","o":["I want to be a doctor.","I was a student.","At the hospital."],"a":1,"j":"「将来何になりたい？」に、1番「医者になりたいです」が正解。want to beは「〜になりたい」です。"},{"t":"I'm going to study abroad next year.","o":["It was last year.","Wow, that's great!","Welcome home."],"a":2,"j":"「来年留学するつもりなんだ」に、2番「わあ、すごいね！」が自然な返事です。abroadは「外国で」です。"},{"t":"Why do you want to be a vet?","o":["At the animal hospital.","Yes, I do.","Because I love animals."],"a":3,"j":"「なぜじゅう医さんになりたいの？」に、理由を答えている3番「動物が大好きだから」が正解。vetは「じゅう医」です。"},{"t":"You can do it! Good luck!","o":["Thanks. I'll do my best.","Here you are.","That's too bad."],"a":1,"j":"「きみならできるよ！がんばって！」に、1番「ありがとう。全力をつくすよ」が正解。do my bestは「全力をつくす」です。"}],"p2":[{"d":["A: Aki, your English is really good.","B: Thanks. I want to work in other countries some day.","A: I'm sure you can."],"q":"What does Aki want to do some day?","o":["Write books.","Teach English.","Work in other countries.","Make a movie."],"a":3,"j":"I want to work in other countries「いつか外国で働きたい」と言っています。some dayは「いつか」です。"},{"d":["A: My dream is to be a pilot.","B: Cool, Hiro! Then you can fly all over the world.","A: Yes. I study hard for it."],"q":"What is Hiro's dream?","o":["To be a police officer.","To travel by ship.","To make planes.","To be a pilot."],"a":4,"j":"My dream is to be a pilot「ぼくの夢はパイロットになること」と言っています。"},{"d":["A: What are you drawing, Emma?","B: A cake shop. I want to have my own shop in the future.","A: Your cakes will be popular!"],"q":"What does Emma want to have?","o":["A cake shop.","A restaurant.","A book store.","A flower shop."],"a":1,"j":"I want to have my own shop「自分のお店を持ちたい」、それはケーキ屋さんです。my ownは「自分自身の」です。"}],"p3":[{"p":"Shun wants to be a soccer player. He practices every day, and he also studies English hard. He wants to play on a team in Europe some day.","q":"Why does Shun study English?","o":["His mother told him to.","He wants to play in Europe.","He likes his teacher.","He wants to teach English."],"a":2,"j":"ヨーロッパのチームでプレーしたいから、サッカーだけでなく英語もがんばっています。Europeは「ヨーロッパ」です。"},{"p":"Mio's mother is a nurse. She sometimes works at night, but she always says, \"I love my job.\" Mio respects her and wants to be a nurse, too.","q":"What does Mio want to be?","o":["A singer.","A doctor.","A nurse.","A teacher."],"a":3,"j":"wants to be a nurse, too「ミオも看護師になりたい」とあります。respectは「そんけいする」です。"},{"p":"Today, a famous baker came to our school and talked about his job. He said, \"Making bread is hard, but the smiles of the people make me happy.\" I will remember his words.","q":"Who came to the school today?","o":["A doctor.","A famous singer.","A soccer player.","A famous baker."],"a":4,"j":"a famous baker「有名なパン職人」が来て、仕事について話してくれました。bakerは「パンを作る人」です。"}]}];
